{"unit_id":"DamonKoy__dsh-plugin-toggle#card-zh","repo":"DamonKoy/dsh-plugin-toggle","commit":"be4d811aebbc9aa972383dd713ed81b48195b181","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-toggle 是面向 DSH 网页端的插件管理面板，在“设置 → 插件”中列出已加载的插件及其描述、启用状态和运行阶段。用户可以按名称、模块、条目 ID、描述或分类进行模糊搜索，查看分组和排序后的结果，并在确认后启动或停止可切换的插件；核心和界面相关条目会受到保护。切换只更新当前运行状态，不改写配置文件，操作记录会保存在本机并可在页面查看。适合需要从网页设置页检查和临时管理 DSH 插件的用户；需要安装到 DSH web profile 并重启网页服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:138-149","client/client.js:194-229","client/client.js:241-269"]}
{"unit_id":"DamonKoy__dsh-plugin-toggle#card-en","repo":"DamonKoy/dsh-plugin-toggle","commit":"be4d811aebbc9aa972383dd713ed81b48195b181","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-toggle adds a DSH web settings panel to list loaded plugins, show status, and search by name, ID, description, or category. Users can start or stop eligible plugins with confirmation; core entries are protected. Toggles affect runtime state, and recent actions are kept in a local log.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:138-149","client/client.js:194-229","client/client.js:241-269"]}
